<title>SRI LANKA: Royal Ceramic says 9-mth net up 5.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Royal Ceramic says 9-mth net up 5.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Royal Ceramics Lanka Ltd for the nine months ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>	   (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		    1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	   407.87   vs	   246.80</p>
<p>    Net profit	  56.62   vs	    53.59</p>
<p>    Tax		    1.84   vs	     1.92</p>
<p>NOTE - Royal Ceramics Ltd makes ceramicware for export.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
